{"ID":"20240513083412-xv63adg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083412-xv63adg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083412-xv63adg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105211-mbpmpxu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105211-mbpmpxu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:411,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105211-mbpmpxu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:533,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:533\u0026#125;","title":"044","type":"doc","updated":"20240515125758"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513105211-mbpmpxu","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 913px;","id":"20240513105211-mbpmpxu","updated":"20240515125758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄   初診日期：2008/03/25"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"030-1 E, D"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/3/25"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血小板減少、紫瘢症，使用免疫球蛋白注射治療"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡可通宵"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便每日一行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小便淡黃、清"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 胃口易餓、吃很多、可吃任何東西"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口渴尚好，喜溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 睡時身熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 易出汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 晨起累，運動後也累"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 雙足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 手指尖冷，手掌溫，額溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大中空"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→脈大為癆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃白厚；早上白濕"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→濕盛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎區大、反應差"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→腎陽不足 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾區過大"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→脾陽不足  因脾主肌、肝主筋，所以運動後累。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區破洞"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、身體："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"膚表可見青紫網狀血脈"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→因脾陽不足，脾主肌肉，故血脈(屬陰)浮現肌表；陽不固，則陰不內守!"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽不足、脾陽不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：當歸四逆(建中)湯合桂芍知母湯加減"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 桂枝三錢  白芍六錢  炙甘草三錢  大棗十枚  當歸二錢  木通二錢  細辛二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→當歸四逆(建中)湯，補後天之本"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮三錢  茯苓五錢  淮山三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→健脾去濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢  黃芩三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→疏肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉五錢  補骨脂三錢  敗龜板三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子三錢  麻黃二錢  防風三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→桂芍知母湯 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗  服時加一匙麥芽糖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.  HT-46(六味地黃丸)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補先天之本  302  午飯及睡前服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 自體免疫系統疾病(當西醫不知道病人身上到底發生了啥事時冠上的病名!)，其實來源於疫苗!"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}